<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-1903] Fix VCL vector %*% vector implementation</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1903</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Vector %&lt;b&gt;% vector and vector %&lt;/b&gt;% Matrix need to have memory allocation Re-written.  Currently they are commented out in tests&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13033547">MAHOUT-1903</key>
            <summary>Fix VCL vector %*% vector implementation</summary>
